.TH "RAPTOR-GUI" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-gui \- Open the desktop application, optionally with MODEL. This is also what 'raptor' with no command does.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor gui\fR [\-h] [\-\-new] [\-\-theme {light,dark}] [MODEL]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open the desktop application, optionally with MODEL. This is also what 'raptor' with no command does.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-\-new\fR
start with a new blank model
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fI{light|dark}\fR
set the theme (saved)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
